<h1>Fan Hub Plus — TechWiz 7 (Fandom Universe)</h1>
<p><strong>End-to-End Web Solutions — Mandatory ReadMe &amp; Technical Documentation</strong></p>

<h2>1. Problem Definition</h2>
<p>Pop-culture enthusiasts across <strong>Anime, Gaming, Movies, TV Shows / Cartoons, K-Pop, Comics, Manga, and Cosplay</strong> face fragmented content across disconnected portals. <strong>Fan Hub Plus</strong> provides a unified, responsive, and accessible web application featuring multi-level content exploration, character profiles, display-only merchandise showcases, interactive Leaflet/OpenStreetMap event maps, moderated community articles, personal bookmarking with notes, and a domain-focused AI Fandom Assistant.</p>

<h2>2. Mandatory Project Installation &amp; Execution Instructions</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Install XAMPP / WAMP</strong> with Apache, MySQL, and PHP 8.x enabled.</li>
  <li><strong>Copy Project Directory</strong>: Place <code>club-main</code> inside <code>htdocs</code> (e.g., <code>C:\xampp\htdocs\club-main</code> or <code>D:\xammppp\htdocs\club-main</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Start Apache &amp; MySQL</strong> from the XAMPP Control Panel.</li>
  <li><strong>Run 1-Click Database Installer</strong>: Open <code>http://localhost/club-main/install.php</code> in your browser to automatically create and seed the <code>fan_hub_plus</code> database (or import <code>schema.sql</code> via phpMyAdmin).</li>
  <li><strong>Open Application</strong>: Visit <code>http://localhost/club-main/index.php</code>.</li>
</ol>

<h2>3. Mandatory User Credentials</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Role</th><th>Email</th><th>Password</th><th>Portal URL</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><strong>Administrator</strong></td><td><code>admin@fanhubplus.test</code></td><td><code>Admin@123</code></td><td><code>/admin/index.php</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Regular User</strong></td><td><code>user@fanhubplus.test</code></td><td><code>User@123</code></td><td><code>/dashboard.php</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>4. Design Specifications &amp; Architecture</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Frontend</strong>: HTML5, CSS3 (Custom properties for Dark/Light themes, responsive 4-column grid), Vanilla JavaScript ES6 (<code>assets/js/app.js</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Backend</strong>: PHP 8.x with MySQLi prepared/escaped queries, CSRF token protection, and role-based server guards (<code>require_login()</code>, <code>require_admin()</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Database</strong>: Normalized MySQL schema (<code>schema.sql</code>) with 12 tables: <code>users</code>, <code>categories</code>, <code>contents</code>, <code>character_profiles</code>, <code>events</code>, <code>merchandise_items</code>, <code>bookmarks</code>, <code>item_bookmarks</code>, <code>media_ratings</code>, <code>feedback</code>, <code>activity_logs</code>, and <code>chatbot_queries</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>External APIs &amp; Libraries</strong>: Leaflet 1.9.4 + OpenStreetMap tiles for geolocation event mapping; Google Gemini / OpenAI-compatible AI endpoint + Local Fandom Knowledge Engine for the AI Chatbot.</li>
</ul>

