<h2>6. AI Tools Acknowledgment</h2>
<p>This project integrates an AI-powered Fandom Assistant (<code>assistant.php</code>, <code>config/ai.php</code>) supporting Google Gemini API and OpenAI-compatible endpoints with a built-in Fandom Knowledge fallback, and utilized AI pair-programming assistance for SRS compliance verification and documentation.</p>
